      "role": "user",
      "content": "Those are pretty poetic, but I'm worried the first one sounds a bit too... I don't know, \"mystical\"? Like it's focusing more on their spirituality and \"spirit\" than their actual intelligence or engineering. \n\nCould you try rewriting the first section to be a bit more descriptive of the actual complexity of those tools? I want to make sure visitors understand that these weren't just \"sacred expressions,\" but actual sophisticated engineering. Maybe contrast that more sharply with the \"reason\" and \"logic\" of the second section to show how much the human mind changed?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
