      "content": "That's getting closer. I like the idea of calling it \"empirical cunning\" vs \"abstract theory,\" but I want to push that distinction even further for the exhibit's narrative. \n\nCould you draft a concluding paragraph for the whole exhibit that summarizes this transition? I want it to really drive home the idea that while the first era was a time of intuitive, instinctual knowledge tied to the physical world, the second era represents humanity finally breaking free from those primitive limitations to achieve true, objective logic. It should feel like a definitive step up in the complexity of the human intellect.",
